      "writtenOn": "2026-03-03T16:03:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I went to change it thinking it could be made `kData` and `const` and discovered the real reason behind this. It\u0027s passed into `SkBitmap::installPixels`, takes in non-const data to theoretically be able to modify the pixel store. In this case we don\u0027t modify the data, but it technically means that this array is a regular global array and not a constant hence `g` vs. `k`.",
      "parentUuid": "b7f8fc8f_4e573992",
